<< <https://k.loria.fr/ontologies/trainingonto-individuals#megnet_elasticity_pretraining> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Pretraining of MEGNet elasticity models (bulk and shear moduli) on 12,179 crystals from the Materials Project database with DFT-computed elastic moduli."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> >> prov:wasDerivedFrom "Section 2.2 and Section 5.2" ; dcterms:source <https://arxiv.org/pdf/2104.10242.pdf> .
